# Akamu ACME — Renewal Information (RFC 9702)
Output docs/gifs/16-acme-ari.mp4
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1200
Set Height 900
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set Padding 20
Set TypingSpeed 25ms
Set Shell "bash"

Type "# ACME Renewal Information (ARI) — akamu-rsa.cert-lab.local (RFC 9702)"
Enter
Sleep 1s

Type "# Issue a cert, then query ARI for its renewal window"
Enter
Type `bash scripts/demo-ari-query.sh`
Enter
Sleep 20s
